do MusicPlayer.pause_music()
audio "res://Audio/Music/WackyJunkATron.wav" [volume="0.0" bus="Music"]
do CutsceneManager.disable_player_functionality()
join ProfStooge rightmost [animation="Slide In Up" wait="true"]
ProfStooge: You've done it! You, Sonny, have single-handedly funded the Starspire Guild! We'll all be gazillionaires now that my signature Junk-A-Tron is officially complete! Absolutely revolutionary!
join TowerGuide leftmost [animation="Slide From Left" wait="true" mirrored="true"]
TowerGuide: A little dramatic, don't ya think?
ProfStooge: On the contrary! Cast aside your doubts. With the help of our young rookie here, I can assure you the Junk-A-Tron will be a massive hit among the Guild! Turning scrap from the tower into novelty inventions the world must see! We'll be able to keep the operation running indefinitely!
TowerGuide: Well, you've done great work for us in the past... The Guild is a bit desperate for funds right now.
TowerGuide: How the heck does this thing even work, anyways?
ProfStooge: It's simple, really! Bring the resources to the machine, plop them in, hit start, and something shall pop out the other end! Once the invention appears, just take it over to the market and sell it in bulk. Easy! Absolutely foolproof!
TowerGuide: Ridiculous... **Rolls eyes**
ProfStooge: What was that there, Sonny? My hearing isn't what it used to be these days.
TowerGuide: Oh, it's nothing! It just sounds like magic to me.
ProfStooge: You can rest assured, Sonny, that this isn't any sort of magic or tomfoolery! This is THE state-of-the-art technology, built using only the finest resources discovered within the Starspire Tower. IT IS THE FUTURE!
TowerGuide: Well, whatever you say. You all enjoy your new toy! The Guild is curious to see where this leads. We've learned not to underestimate you, Professor Stooge.
leave TowerGuide [animation="Slide To Left" wait="true"]
ProfStooge: It's just you and me now, Sonny. Let's show 'em what we're made of!
do CutsceneManager.set_camera_to_player()
do CutsceneManager.zoom_camera_standard()
[wait time="1.0"]
do CutsceneManager.enable_player_functionality()
do MusicPlayer.unpause_music()